                                        "sense_id": "8a545e26-daea-30fa-a5e6-6a3885495e33",
                                        "entry_id": "c01d4411-54c2-34c3-9907-9cee4ece39fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A low wall, serving as a foundation, a substructure, or a terrace wall.",
                                            "The masonry under the stylobate of a temple, sometimes a mere foundation, sometimes containing chambers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c3590433-7283-36ff-91c8-6bcec4ef59be",
                                        "entry_id": "c01d4411-54c2-34c3-9907-9cee4ece39fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The lower portion of a high-rise building, typically of several storeys tall and acts as a foundation to the tower(s) above it."
